{"from":"1:1","body":"<p><ref to=\"JON.1.1\">1</ref> Jonah, sent to Nineveh, flees to Tarshish.<br/><ref to=\"JON.1.4\">4</ref> He is bewrayed by a tempest;<br/><ref to=\"JON.1.11\">11</ref> thrown into the sea;<br/><ref to=\"JON.1.17\">17</ref> and swallowed by a fish.<br/><br/><br/>Jonah.<br/><ref to=\"2KI.14.25 MAT.12.39 MAT.16.4 LUK.11.29 LUK.11.30 LUK.11.32\">2Ki 14:25; Mt 12:39; 16:4; Lu 11:29,30,32</ref><br/>Jonas.</p>"}
